# Rust build output (workspace target dir and any crate-level target dirs)
target/
target-*/
**/*.rs.bk

# Downloaded toolchains and SDKs. `UPl/` holds a full Vulkan SDK (~1.7 GB
# installed plus the installer); it is a machine-local dependency, not source,
# and would otherwise be committed by anyone who followed the setup step.
UPl/

# Editor / OS artefacts
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local assets: photos and a test model, ~182 MB of binaries with no source in
# them. A `git add -A` without this line stages the lot, and `Model/` alone is
# 968 075 "lines" - it drowns out the ~11 500 lines of real source that are
# untracked and therefore one `git checkout` away from gone.
Model/
